abstract: "Research beta exploring causal sliding-window training from scratch with disjoint compressed inference and residual-sum aggregation. Experiments use the SmolLM2 configuration/tokenizer, Hugging Face Transformers and WikiText; earlier work builds on nanoGPT. Development assisted by Gemini and ChatGPT/Codex."
